WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 28=

22
01:58.023 --> 01:58.583
Watch closely.

23
01:59.023 --> 02:00.223
Make a fist like this,

24
02:00.462 --> 02:01.742
thirty reps per set,

25
02:02.262 --> 02:03.822
and do at least three sets a day.

26
02:04.223 --> 02:04.703
This way,

27
02:05.063 --> 02:06.723
it'll help the recovery of your muscle.

28
02:06.863 --> 02:07.375
(Ms. Hui,)

29
02:07.542 --> 02:08.342
(don't panic yet.)

30
02:08.662 --> 02:09.742
(Di Liren is too cunning.)

31
02:10.143 --> 02:10.942
(About the IOU,)

32
02:11.502 --> 02:12.423
(I'll figure it out.)

33
02:16.023 --> 02:16.942
(Di Liren) Let's meet.

34
02:18.103 --> 02:18.782
The two of us,

35
02:19.703 --> 02:20.627
go back to Xiaocheng.

36
02:21.703 --> 02:22.103
Okay.

37
02:22.942 --> 02:24.303
Dad's death anniversary is coming.

38
02:24.902 --> 02:26.182
We can visit graves by the way.

39
02:29.444 --> 02:31.584
(The beneficiary of your insurance has changed.)

40
02:31.584 --> 02:32.512
(Rate our service.)

41
02:34.742 --> 02:35.222
Okay.

42
02:36.263 --> 02:37.342
Dad told me in my dream

43
02:38.303 --> 02:39.143
that he really wanted

44
02:40.103 --> 02:40.742
to see you.

45
02:42.742 --> 02:43.662
Di Liren asked to meet.

46
02:44.583 --> 02:45.583
We'll go to Xiaocheng.

47
02:47.303 --> 02:48.303
After I knew he's related

48
02:48.383 --> 02:49.143
to my dad's death,

49
02:50.182 --> 02:50.983
I can't stop

50
02:51.902 --> 02:52.543
thinking about

51
02:52.662 --> 02:53.703
everything that happened.

52
02:54.583 --> 02:55.543
When I think about how

53
02:55.622 --> 02:57.622
he lay beside me as if nothing happened,

54
02:59.303 --> 03:00.543
it makes me sick.

55
03:02.543 --> 03:04.222
He has to pay for this.

56
03:05.383 --> 03:06.303
Before, I thought

57
03:07.462 --> 03:08.742
I was cursed with bad luck.

58
03:09.103 --> 03:10.983
My mom and my dad died one after another.

59
03:12.023 --> 03:13.182
I thought he had it tough

60
03:13.742 --> 03:14.983
all because of me.

61
03:17.222 --> 03:18.303
I owed him this.

62
03:19.502 --> 03:20.103
But when I know

63
03:20.143 --> 03:21.222
he's the culprit

64
03:21.263 --> 03:21.983
behind all this.

65
03:22.823 --> 03:24.062
He ruined my life.

66
03:24.983 --> 03:25.983
How can I let him off?

67
03:27.062 --> 03:27.983
Just watch him get away

68
03:28.062 --> 03:28.863
with it?

69
03:31.143 --> 03:32.023
No, Ms. Hui.

70
03:33.143 --> 03:34.462
He will pay for this.

71
03:34.942 --> 03:35.902
But what if he...

72
03:36.182 --> 03:36.983
You can't risk

73
03:37.062 --> 03:37.742
your life.

74
03:37.942 --> 03:38.983
That was my dad!

75
03:39.863 --> 03:40.823
If you were me,

76
03:42.143 --> 03:42.902
what would you do?

77
03:47.902 --> 03:48.303
See?

78
03:50.303 --> 03:51.662
We're the same.

79
03:53.143 --> 03:53.942
If you were me,

80
03:54.502 --> 03:54.983
you would do

81
03:55.062 --> 03:56.103
the same as I do.

82
04:00.502 --> 04:01.263
I just think

83
04:01.583 --> 04:02.902
if he harmed your dad for money,

84
04:03.662 --> 04:04.502
he could harm you.

85
04:05.303 --> 04:06.103
What about Harry?

86
04:07.662 --> 04:09.182
His surgery will be held next week,

87
04:09.342 --> 04:09.863
and

88
04:09.863 --> 04:10.863
he has a long period

89
04:10.942 --> 04:11.902
of rehab ahead.

90
04:12.222 --> 04:13.502
He really needs you.

91
04:14.662 --> 04:16.143
If anything happens to you,

92
04:16.902 --> 04:17.263
what will he do?

93
04:17.263 --> 04:18.102
Enough, stop it.

94
04:20.782 --> 04:21.542
As you say,

95
04:22.503 --> 04:23.023
I won't go

96
04:23.063 --> 04:24.102
after Di Liren for now.

97
04:29.102 --> 04:29.703
Here you go.

98
04:30.902 --> 04:31.823
Take care of Harry.

99
04:35.102 --> 04:35.462
Okay.

100
04:42.662 --> 04:44.183
I don't know her. I can't tell.

101
04:45.902 --> 04:47.063
Take a look at this, Dad.

102
04:48.743 --> 04:49.333
Recognize it?

103
04:51.023 --> 04:52.383
I know this guy.

104
04:52.623 --> 04:53.662
Is this me?

105
04:56.662 --> 04:57.583
That's you, right?

106
04:59.902 --> 05:00.743
And the middle one?

107
05:01.623 --> 05:02.782
The middle one...

108
05:05.102 --> 05:06.102
This is my mom.

109
05:06.422 --> 05:06.982
This photo

110
05:07.063 --> 05:08.222
was taken when I was 18,

111
05:08.263 --> 05:09.943
you two took me to college.

112
05:10.542 --> 05:11.183
Remember?

113
05:13.623 --> 05:14.263
No.

114
05:16.183 --> 05:17.542
Take a look at this, Dad.

115
05:18.383 --> 05:18.902
This one.

116
05:19.623 --> 05:21.782
This is Mr. Tian.

117
05:23.943 --> 05:24.542
Don't know him.

118
05:25.982 --> 05:26.743
This is my mom too.

119
05:28.383 --> 05:29.662
Back when she was in school.

120
05:29.943 --> 05:30.422
Pretty?

121
05:32.383 --> 05:33.943
Where did you get this photo?

122
05:34.263 --> 05:35.782
This girl was really something.

123
05:36.342 --> 05:38.023
She was the belle

124
05:38.143 --> 05:39.183
of Literature Department.

125
05:39.263 --> 05:40.462
Many guys had a crush on her.

126
05:40.503 --> 05:41.542
Really?

127
05:41.623 --> 05:42.023
Yeah.

128
05:42.982 --> 05:44.862
Where did you find this photo?

129
05:50.662 --> 05:51.183
Dad.

130
05:51.862 --> 05:52.623
Well,

131
05:52.823 --> 05:54.503
do you remember her name?

132
05:55.782 --> 05:56.222
Her name...

133
05:57.823 --> 05:59.342
Lu...

134
06:01.743 --> 06:02.383
What is it?

135
06:03.383 --> 06:04.222
I get it, Dad.

136
06:04.862 --> 06:06.143
You must have been

137
06:06.183 --> 06:07.503
one of the guys

138
06:07.583 --> 06:08.503
who had a crush on her

139
06:08.503 --> 06:09.302
back then, right?

140
06:10.462 --> 06:11.342
Don't even mention it.

141
06:12.063 --> 06:13.462
I wasn't in her league.

142
06:13.623 --> 06:15.823
She came from a wealthy family.

143
06:15.902 --> 06:16.623
I was so poor.

144
06:16.623 --> 06:18.063
She wouldn't even look at me.

145
06:18.703 --> 06:19.263
And I

146
06:19.263 --> 06:21.263
didn't want to be a live-in husband.

147
06:22.383 --> 06:23.222
Thinking back now,

148
06:23.263 --> 06:24.902
it feels so distant,

149
06:25.823 --> 06:28.183
yet like it happened yesterday.

150
06:32.143 --> 06:32.862
I'm sorry.

151
06:33.222 --> 06:34.823
I really can't recall

152
06:34.943 --> 06:35.623
who you are.

153
06:35.743 --> 06:36.542
And I can't recall

154
06:36.583 --> 06:37.662
who your mom is.

155
06:38.862 --> 06:40.023
But weird,

156
06:40.143 --> 06:41.583
in the back of my mind,

157
06:41.982 --> 06:44.102
a voice keeps telling me

158
06:45.063 --> 06:46.422
never to upset your mom.

159
06:46.982 --> 06:48.342
If she cries, I'll be in trouble.

160
06:48.383 --> 06:49.823
Soothing her is a tough task.

161
06:51.943 --> 06:53.263
You don't have to recognize us.

162
06:53.583 --> 06:54.943
Maybe this is fate.

163
06:55.743 --> 06:56.102
Alright.

164
06:56.782 --> 06:58.583
Let's introduce ourselves again.

165
06:58.862 --> 06:59.302
Hello,

166
06:59.862 --> 07:00.782
I'm Lu Lizhen.

167
07:02.222 --> 07:02.862
Hello,

168
07:05.583 --> 07:06.782
I'm Yu Jianguo.

169
07:09.703 --> 07:10.383
Go to the couch.

170
07:10.823 --> 07:11.183
Okay.

171
07:11.623 --> 07:12.422
Easy, easy.

172
07:13.823 --> 07:14.743
Easy. Okay.

173
07:15.263 --> 07:15.823
Lie down.

174
07:16.063 --> 07:16.422
Here.

175
07:17.422 --> 07:18.114
Just a second.

176
07:25.662 --> 07:26.222
No.

177
07:26.743 --> 07:28.263
I have to pick up Chestnut.

178
07:29.183 --> 07:29.703
I'll get her.

179
07:31.383 --> 07:32.183
What about dinner?

180
07:32.383 --> 07:32.841
I'll cook.

181
07:33.583 --> 07:34.302
You cook?

182
07:34.743 --> 07:36.263
I'd rather order takeout.

183
07:36.743 --> 07:37.102
Wait.

184
07:47.982 --> 07:48.743
You bought them?

185
07:49.503 --> 07:50.183
So many?

186
07:51.222 --> 07:51.943
They are the same

187
07:52.063 --> 07:52.862
as the ones I use.

188
07:53.623 --> 07:53.982
I can't tell

189
07:53.982 --> 07:54.943
the difference.

190
07:55.183 --> 07:56.342
I bought as your posts said.

191
07:59.063 --> 08:00.063
How's your back?

192
08:00.383 --> 08:01.612
Got hurt by carrying a camera?

193
08:01.743 --> 08:02.542
My back

194
08:02.703 --> 08:03.943
just keeps acting up.

195
08:04.623 --> 08:05.342
Seen a doctor?

196
08:06.023 --> 08:07.063
No time for that.

197
08:07.542 --> 08:08.583
Who took care of you

198
08:08.623 --> 08:09.222
before?

199
08:09.823 --> 08:10.183
Liu Bai?

200
08:11.183 --> 08:12.703
He's away at school all the time.

201
08:12.823 --> 08:13.782
I can't rely on him.

202
08:14.943 --> 08:15.662
Don't worry.

203
08:16.143 --> 08:17.503
I'm a mother and an older sister,

204
08:17.623 --> 08:18.623
the two strongest kinds

205
08:18.743 --> 08:19.583
of women.

206
08:20.063 --> 08:21.263
I can handle everything.

207
08:22.143 --> 08:23.263
I don't think you're strong,

208
08:23.743 --> 08:24.503
but foolish.

209
08:24.823 --> 08:26.183
Go to the hospital when you're sick.

210
08:26.183 --> 08:27.143
Take rest when unwell.

211
08:27.583 --> 08:28.583
Even Chestnut knows that.

212
08:28.703 --> 08:29.422
Why don't you?

213
08:29.662 --> 08:30.623
You're the foolish one.

214
08:30.943 --> 08:32.263
Can't you say some sweet words?

215
08:41.023 --> 08:42.062
I've always admired you.

216
08:42.902 --> 08:44.023
Raising Chestnut on your own

217
08:44.743 --> 08:46.350
while taking care of Yu Meng and Liu Bai.

218
08:46.623 --> 08:47.582
You're more amazing

219
08:47.863 --> 08:48.463
than you think.

220
08:52.343 --> 08:53.863
I'm not that amazing.

221
08:55.383 --> 08:55.983
Getting better?

222
08:56.822 --> 08:57.263
No.

223
08:57.863 --> 08:58.782
Then sweet words can't

224
08:58.983 --> 08:59.542
cure you.

225
09:00.182 --> 09:00.582
You!

226
09:06.582 --> 09:06.942
Alright.

227
09:07.383 --> 09:08.863
Appointment booked for tomorrow morning.

228
09:08.863 --> 09:09.422
I'll take you.

229
09:10.463 --> 09:11.582
I'll make you some food,

230
09:11.743 --> 09:13.103
then pick up Chestnut in an hour.

231
09:13.422 --> 09:13.743
I...

232
09:14.422 --> 09:15.503
You have an event tomorrow.

233
09:15.702 --> 09:16.143
I know.

234
09:16.463 --> 09:17.023
I'll get help.

235
09:17.542 --> 09:18.463
Your only job right now

236
09:18.463 --> 09:19.422
is to lie down,

237
09:20.223 --> 09:20.863
take rest,

238
09:21.343 --> 09:21.993
and be quiet.

239
09:29.023 --> 09:30.743
No cilantro or scallions.

240
09:31.263 --> 09:32.143
I want eggs,

241
09:32.902 --> 09:34.182
sunny-side up with runny yolk.

242
09:35.623 --> 09:36.782
And I want soup too.

243
09:38.103 --> 09:38.542
Alright.

244
09:47.902 --> 09:49.542
Harry is an adult.

245
09:49.782 --> 09:51.343
It's just skin graft surgery.

246
09:51.702 --> 09:52.822
Why bring so much stuff?

247
09:53.422 --> 09:55.023
What's this? This one.

248
09:55.782 --> 09:56.822
Medical silicone tape.

249
09:57.143 --> 09:58.182
For scar recovery.

250
09:58.983 --> 09:59.662
What about this?

251
10:00.422 --> 10:00.782
This one.

252
10:01.103 --> 10:02.182
A spray

253
10:02.662 --> 10:04.302
to relieve his pain and burning sensation.

254
10:05.223 --> 10:06.702
Doesn't the hospital have all this?

255
10:08.103 --> 10:08.782
Stop

256
10:08.902 --> 10:09.702
asking questions.

257
10:09.782 --> 10:10.623
We brought them...

258
10:10.902 --> 10:12.223
Oh, no! Fang Haoyu is missing.

259
10:15.548 --> 10:18.647
(Wu Ta)

260
10:33.863 --> 10:34.702
Have you seen Harry?

261
10:35.062 --> 10:35.623
No.

262
10:48.463 --> 10:49.143
Seen Harry?

263
10:50.062 --> 10:50.503
No.

264
10:59.343 --> 11:00.302
Where else could he go?

265
11:06.143 --> 11:07.329
The hospital staff found him.

266
11:14.782 --> 11:15.702
(Under Harry's bed,)

267
11:15.743 --> 11:16.743
(there's a white USB.)

268
11:17.182 --> 11:17.863
(It's a backup)

269
11:17.942 --> 11:19.223
(of Di Liren's criminal evidence.)

270
11:19.223 --> 11:20.223
(If I go missing,)

271
11:20.503 --> 11:21.143
(call the cops.)

272
11:21.302 --> 11:21.702
Oh, no.

273
11:22.623 --> 11:23.422
Lu Hui is in danger.

274
11:24.902 --> 11:26.182
We haven't gone back together

275
11:27.863 --> 11:28.782
for five or six years?

276
11:29.263 --> 11:30.422
I've been visiting the graves

277
11:30.463 --> 11:31.463
all by myself.

278
11:34.103 --> 11:34.702
Thank you.

279
11:37.782 --> 11:39.023
These years,

280
11:39.422 --> 11:40.887
I had to visit Yu family's graves.

281
11:42.103 --> 11:42.942
I didn't know

282
11:43.062 --> 11:44.062
any of those names,

283
11:44.822 --> 11:45.782
yet I had to

284
11:45.902 --> 11:46.863
burn incense and kowtow.

285
11:48.302 --> 11:49.023
Now my normal life

286
11:49.143 --> 11:49.863
is finally back.

287
11:52.103 --> 11:52.623
It's great.

288
11:58.623 --> 11:59.582
Do you remember

289
12:00.302 --> 12:01.383
when we first met

290
12:01.503 --> 12:02.263
each other?

291
12:02.822 --> 12:03.223
I do.

292
12:04.582 --> 12:06.023
Your dad donated money to our school

293
12:06.863 --> 12:07.623
to set up

294
12:07.863 --> 12:08.983
a financial aid fund.

295
12:09.623 --> 12:10.623
I was chosen

296
12:10.702 --> 12:11.422
to accept it.

297
12:11.782 --> 12:12.343
At that time,

298
12:12.863 --> 12:13.942
you were next to your dad

299
12:14.542 --> 12:15.343
in a white dress,

300
12:15.782 --> 12:16.743
like a princess.

301
12:18.662 --> 12:20.182
My dad funded you to finish education.

302
12:20.503 --> 12:20.983
And you came

303
12:21.062 --> 12:22.343
to work at our garment factory.

304
12:23.702 --> 12:24.983
My dad promoted you

305
12:25.822 --> 12:27.263
to become a team lead.

306
12:27.623 --> 12:28.662
I had some education.

307
12:29.582 --> 12:30.983
I was different from others.

308
12:32.343 --> 12:33.383
I can understand your dad.

309
12:33.743 --> 12:34.383
And

310
12:34.822 --> 12:35.582
we hit it off.

311
12:36.062 --> 12:36.782
Why did you...?

312
12:38.383 --> 12:38.863
What?

313
12:40.503 --> 12:41.023
Nothing.

314
12:41.182 --> 12:41.743
I mean,

315
12:42.302 --> 12:43.103
why did you not turn

316
12:43.182 --> 12:43.902
just now?

317
12:44.503 --> 12:45.383
That way is faster.

318
12:58.383 --> 12:58.782
Harry!

319
13:00.582 --> 13:01.062
Harry!

320
13:06.623 --> 13:07.702
So you're still hiding

321
13:08.463 --> 13:09.422
something from me.

322
13:11.623 --> 13:12.543
Will they go to prison?

323
13:16.223 --> 13:16.662
Yes.

324
13:27.422 --> 13:28.463
I'm not doing the surgery.

325
13:30.383 --> 13:31.302
I think some things

326
13:32.542 --> 13:33.942
are just like the scars on my body.

327
13:35.143 --> 13:35.942
No matter how,

328
13:37.463 --> 13:38.542
they can never recover.

329
13:41.103 --> 13:42.023
But they can be fixed.

330
13:42.782 --> 13:43.662
In the same situation,

331
13:44.822 --> 13:45.902
some give up on themselves,

332
13:46.702 --> 13:48.069
while others try hard to fix it.

333
13:49.383 --> 13:50.743
Your mom left that USB for you.

334
13:51.103 --> 13:51.743
Clearly,

335
13:52.782 --> 13:53.782
she chose the latter.

336
13:56.023 --> 13:56.582
Harry,

337
13:57.743 --> 13:58.623
she is brave.

338
14:00.103 --> 14:00.702
And you?

339
14:03.023 --> 14:04.143
I called her.

340
14:05.023 --> 14:05.735
No one answered.

341
14:07.143 --> 14:08.225
I don't know where she is.

342
14:09.422 --> 14:10.023
I do.

343
14:11.343 --> 14:12.062
In Xiaocheng.

344
14:16.582 --> 14:17.143
I'll take you.

345
14:18.463 --> 14:19.052
Shall we go?

346
14:32.983 --> 14:33.902
Remember this place?

347
14:34.223 --> 14:35.182
We used to come here.

348
14:35.463 --> 14:35.902
I do.

349
14:36.623 --> 14:37.582
I often think

350
14:38.143 --> 14:38.702
that was

351
14:38.743 --> 14:39.782
the best time

352
14:40.463 --> 14:42.182
in my entire life.

353
14:42.863 --> 14:44.103
You had just gotten pregnant,

354
14:44.702 --> 14:45.422
and my job

355
14:45.782 --> 14:46.463
was quite steady.

356
14:47.302 --> 14:48.662
It felt like the future is bright,

357
14:49.103 --> 14:49.942
and full of hope.

358
14:50.863 --> 14:52.247
I wish we were back in those days.

359
14:52.662 --> 14:53.182
Really?

360
14:54.182 --> 14:55.223
I never thought that way.

361
14:56.182 --> 14:57.302
Just try.

362
14:59.263 --> 15:00.343
If you can go back in time,

363
15:00.782 --> 15:01.743
then when?

364
15:02.103 --> 15:02.983
When my dad

365
15:03.062 --> 15:03.743
was still alive.

366
15:12.182 --> 15:13.503
It tastes just like before.

367
15:16.062 --> 15:16.822
Whenever I said

368
15:16.942 --> 15:17.902
I wanted hot pot,

369
15:18.743 --> 15:19.942
you'd ride your motorcycle

370
15:20.743 --> 15:22.450
and pass through the street to pick me up

371
15:22.503 --> 15:23.302
at the hospital.

372
15:24.023 --> 15:24.503
Yeah.

373
15:24.902 --> 15:25.702
After just one meal,

374
15:26.223 --> 15:26.863
the smell

375
15:26.942 --> 15:27.983
would cling for days.

376
15:30.182 --> 15:30.942
Then we had Haoyu.

377
15:31.542 --> 15:31.942
He loved

378
15:32.062 --> 15:33.062
the rice shop next door.

379
15:34.023 --> 15:34.503
Remember?

380
15:35.863 --> 15:36.542
Sadly,

381
15:36.902 --> 15:37.942
that shop has closed down.

382
15:38.103 --> 15:38.863
Both of our jobs

383
15:38.902 --> 15:39.662
were nearby,

384
15:40.542 --> 15:41.782
and Haoyu's school wasn't far.

385
15:42.223 --> 15:43.503
Our world was just this small.

386
15:46.623 --> 15:47.062
I've never

387
15:47.062 --> 15:48.103
figured out something.

388
15:50.463 --> 15:51.223
Five years ago,

389
15:51.822 --> 15:53.302
why did you suddenly run into Yu Meng

390
15:53.422 --> 15:55.263
at a place

391
15:55.782 --> 15:57.503
far from Xiaocheng,

392
15:58.623 --> 15:59.343
and

393
15:59.383 --> 16:00.542
saved her?

394
16:01.582 --> 16:02.263
What do you mean?

395
16:02.863 --> 16:03.902
I used to think

396
16:04.463 --> 16:05.463
Yu Meng was a gift

397
16:05.983 --> 16:07.182
meant for us.

398
16:07.983 --> 16:08.623
It's all fate.

399
16:09.503 --> 16:10.702
But what if I was wrong?

400
16:11.902 --> 16:12.863
If it wasn't fate,

401
16:14.383 --> 16:15.383
but a scheme?

402
16:22.702 --> 16:23.582
What do you mean?

403
16:24.942 --> 16:25.902
You think I planned

404
16:25.983 --> 16:26.782
that car crash?

405
16:26.902 --> 16:27.702
Didn't you?

406
16:27.743 --> 16:28.503
Of course not!

407
16:31.143 --> 16:32.623
It was a gift from Heaven.

408
16:33.023 --> 16:33.983
I was just passing by.

409
16:34.103 --> 16:34.623
I had no idea

410
16:34.782 --> 16:35.822
I saved a rich girl.

411
16:36.343 --> 16:37.623
It's a chance to change my life.

412
16:38.422 --> 16:39.542
Fate was helping me,

413
16:40.062 --> 16:41.383
pushing me higher up.

414
16:44.743 --> 16:45.503
Did Peng Cheng

415
16:45.623 --> 16:46.343
go to you?

416
16:47.582 --> 16:48.548
I don't give him money,

417
16:49.143 --> 16:50.143
so he resents me.

418
16:51.143 --> 16:52.503
He never tells any truth.

419
16:52.902 --> 16:53.702
So you chalk it all

420
16:53.822 --> 16:54.863
up to fate?

421
16:55.263 --> 16:55.983
Isn't that true?

422
16:57.623 --> 16:58.743
Whenever I hit a wall,

423
16:59.422 --> 17:00.223
heaven dropped me

424
17:00.223 --> 17:00.983
gifts into my lap,

425
17:01.383 --> 17:02.383
helping me turn disasters

426
17:02.463 --> 17:03.263
into blessings.

427
17:04.342 --> 17:05.223
After many hardships,

428
17:05.342 --> 17:06.382
I am still living fine

429
17:06.463 --> 17:07.302
right here.

430
17:07.822 --> 17:08.903
Later at the hospital,

431
17:08.943 --> 17:10.511
you approached Meng under a fake name,

432
17:10.743 --> 17:11.423
won her over,

433
17:11.542 --> 17:12.983
made her fall for you,

434
17:13.342 --> 17:14.142
and then let me

435
17:14.223 --> 17:15.223
find out all of this.

436
17:15.542 --> 17:16.903
That was all carefully calculated,

437
17:17.542 --> 17:18.023
right?

438
17:19.582 --> 17:19.943
Yes.

439
17:20.542 --> 17:21.503
Why did you lie to me?

440
17:22.062 --> 17:22.582
What else?

441
17:23.943 --> 17:25.382
Should I just tell you,

442
17:26.023 --> 17:26.582
"Hui,

443
17:27.463 --> 17:28.463
let's get a divorce.

444
17:28.943 --> 17:30.263
I'm going after Yu Meng now"?

445
17:31.142 --> 17:31.983
Would you agree?

446
17:32.943 --> 17:34.743
I had to let you figure it out

447
17:35.862 --> 17:37.423
and say it yourself.

448
17:38.663 --> 17:39.503
Otherwise, it'd

449
17:39.503 --> 17:40.821
look like I forced you to do so.

450
17:41.622 --> 17:42.663
So this is my fault?

451
17:43.862 --> 17:44.862
Even now, you still think

452
17:44.943 --> 17:46.263
what you did was right?

453
17:46.782 --> 17:47.663
What did I do wrong?

454
17:48.703 --> 17:49.622
If I hadn't done that,

455
17:50.223 --> 17:51.582
what about Haoyu's medical bills?

456
17:52.102 --> 17:53.102
How did he study abroad?

457
17:53.503 --> 17:54.183
How do you

458
17:54.263 --> 17:55.023
get this good life?

459
17:55.503 --> 17:56.382
If I hadn't done that,

460
17:56.663 --> 17:57.423
we wouldn't just be

461
17:57.542 --> 17:58.782
visiting your dad's grave,

462
17:59.263 --> 18:00.183
but also our son's.

463
18:07.223 --> 18:08.023
Say that again!

464
18:08.342 --> 18:09.183
Am I wrong?

465
18:25.582 --> 18:26.542
Why brought me here?

466
18:28.342 --> 18:28.983
From here,

467
18:28.983 --> 18:30.183
we can see Dad's old factory.

468
18:31.503 --> 18:32.622
After you went to Jiangzhou,

469
18:33.423 --> 18:34.302
whenever I felt lonely

470
18:34.622 --> 18:35.663
and missed my dad,

471
18:36.822 --> 18:38.142
I would come up here alone

472
18:38.822 --> 18:40.023
to talk to him.

473
18:42.023 --> 18:42.822
This is also where

474
18:42.943 --> 18:43.743
you confessed to me.

475
18:45.142 --> 18:45.703
Remember?

476
18:46.503 --> 18:47.302
Dad is gone.

477
18:48.099 --> 18:50.411
(Xiaocheng, 21 years ago)

478
18:56.423 --> 18:57.183
Stay with me.

479
18:58.743 --> 18:59.382
From now on,

480
19:00.302 --> 19:01.223
I'll take care of you.

481
19:05.382 --> 19:06.102
Of course.

482
19:07.382 --> 19:07.822
Look.

483
19:07.822 --> 19:10.226
(Five years ago, Xiaocheng)

484
19:12.102 --> 19:12.822
So beautiful.

485
19:12.903 --> 19:13.983
Say something to Dad.

486
19:15.382 --> 19:16.223
He can hear you.

487
19:22.862 --> 19:23.263
Dad,

488
19:24.023 --> 19:25.263
Hui and I came to see you.

489
19:26.302 --> 19:26.943
Don't worry.

490
19:27.903 --> 19:29.102
We're doing well.

491
19:29.703 --> 19:31.030
Haoyu has been too busy studying

492
19:31.423 --> 19:32.183
to come.

493
19:34.382 --> 19:35.743
If you need anything

494
19:36.342 --> 19:37.023
on your side,

495
19:38.183 --> 19:39.062
just let us know.

496
19:40.423 --> 19:41.782
I dreamed about you days ago.

497
19:42.943 --> 19:44.582
It was the night of your accident.

498
19:46.342 --> 19:47.503
Before heading out, you asked

499
19:48.223 --> 19:49.622
if I wanted to go with you.

500
19:51.663 --> 19:53.142
In the dream, I held you and cried.

501
19:55.342 --> 19:55.822
If I

502
19:55.862 --> 19:57.102
had gone with you,

503
19:58.703 --> 19:59.463
maybe you wouldn't

504
19:59.582 --> 20:00.463
be driving fatigued,

505
20:02.503 --> 20:04.183
maybe the accident wouldn't happen.

506
20:05.102 --> 20:06.183
Then you told me

507
20:07.743 --> 20:09.223
you weren't driving fatigued.

508
20:11.423 --> 20:12.302
There was a truck

509
20:12.382 --> 20:13.463
tailing you.

510
20:14.062 --> 20:15.342
I woke up at once.

511
20:17.503 --> 20:18.463
I can't tell

512
20:19.062 --> 20:20.382
if it was a dream or reality.

513
20:22.423 --> 20:23.223
I can't figure out

514
20:24.943 --> 20:26.302
who would want to hurt you.

515
20:27.703 --> 20:28.943
You never borrowed money,

516
20:30.463 --> 20:31.782
nor lent money to anyone.

517
20:34.302 --> 20:35.903
How could someone want you dead?

518
20:37.183 --> 20:37.743
Hui,

519
20:38.862 --> 20:39.743
you need to let go.

520
20:40.663 --> 20:41.862
If you think like this,

521
20:42.503 --> 20:43.223
I'm afraid

522
20:43.223 --> 20:44.142
you will break down.

523
20:46.382 --> 20:47.703
You were working at the factory.

524
20:49.023 --> 20:50.142
Did you hear of anyone

525
20:50.183 --> 20:50.943
resenting my dad?

526
20:52.142 --> 20:52.622
No.

527
20:59.943 --> 21:00.342
Dad,

528
21:02.703 --> 21:04.142
do you want to tell me

529
21:05.263 --> 21:06.023
there was

530
21:06.142 --> 21:06.983
such a truck?

531
21:09.622 --> 21:10.903
Or did I just miss you so much

532
21:12.542 --> 21:13.342
and I made that up

533
21:13.463 --> 21:15.102
in my own dream?

534
21:25.503 --> 21:26.903
Luckily, I took your advice

535
21:28.542 --> 21:30.062
and made a habit of saving money,

536
21:30.582 --> 21:31.822
so I kept some savings.

537
21:32.582 --> 21:33.862
Haoyu is in the hospital now.

538
21:34.023 --> 21:35.302
Liren is struggling in business.

539
21:35.983 --> 21:37.503
I'm going to take this money out

540
21:38.822 --> 21:40.023
to get through this.

541
21:41.743 --> 21:42.142
Dad,

542
21:42.622 --> 21:43.822
please bless us.

543
21:47.983 --> 21:49.223
You still have savings?

544
21:50.102 --> 21:50.943
Before the trust?

545
21:52.183 --> 21:52.743
So I asked you

546
21:52.782 --> 21:53.622
to come back with me.

547
21:55.822 --> 21:56.582
Where is the money?

548
21:59.302 --> 22:00.023
We'll talk later.

549
22:21.302 --> 22:22.041
Where's the money?

550
22:23.263 --> 22:23.782
No rush.

551
22:24.622 --> 22:25.342
Let's sit down

552
22:25.903 --> 22:26.382
and talk.

553
22:32.023 --> 22:32.703
When I bought

554
22:32.822 --> 22:33.503
this house back,

555
22:33.622 --> 22:34.223
I was thinking

556
22:34.423 --> 22:35.663
about renovating it,

557
22:36.463 --> 22:37.983
so whenever we come back,

558
22:38.382 --> 22:39.173
we could stay here.

559
22:39.943 --> 22:40.703
This is where Haoyu

560
22:40.822 --> 22:41.862
grew up, after all.

561
22:42.223 --> 22:42.822
He likes it.

562
22:44.622 --> 22:45.102
Didn't we

563
22:45.183 --> 22:46.062
leave it to Haoyu?

564
22:46.703 --> 22:47.622
You two can decide.

565
22:48.542 --> 22:49.582
Do you still care about

566
22:50.903 --> 22:51.663
me, Haoyu,

567
22:52.903 --> 22:53.703
and this family?

568
23:02.983 --> 23:03.622
Of course, I do.

569
23:05.263 --> 23:06.542
Why else would I remarry you?

570
23:07.023 --> 23:08.223
Then I'd really love to know

571
23:09.023 --> 23:09.703
how you managed

572
23:09.822 --> 23:10.263
to never

573
23:10.302 --> 23:11.463
utter a single word

574
23:12.023 --> 23:13.503
that you caused

575
23:14.142 --> 23:15.102
my dad's car accident

576
23:15.223 --> 23:16.463
while staying with me

577
23:16.822 --> 23:17.703
for over twenty years.

578
23:19.382 --> 23:20.023
Di Liren,

579
23:21.423 --> 23:22.102
how did you

580
23:22.183 --> 23:23.062
manage to act like

581
23:23.102 --> 23:24.062
nothing ever happened

582
23:25.183 --> 23:25.984
while being with me,

583
23:26.023 --> 23:27.382
even lying next to me?

584
23:29.542 --> 23:30.703
You all forced me to do this.

585
23:31.463 --> 23:32.102
I had no choice.

586
23:32.263 --> 23:33.541
Who forced you to kill my dad?

587
23:33.582 --> 23:34.342
Himself.

588
23:35.862 --> 23:36.782
He threatened

589
23:37.382 --> 23:38.582
to sue me.

590
23:39.382 --> 23:40.382
Besides, I only wanted

591
23:40.503 --> 23:41.263
to scare him.

592
23:41.542 --> 23:42.743
The crash was an accident.

593
23:43.062 --> 23:43.903
I never intended

594
23:44.023 --> 23:44.542
to kill him.

595
23:44.663 --> 23:45.743
Yet you just stood by

596
23:46.983 --> 23:48.183
and let that happen.

597
23:48.622 --> 23:49.463
After the crash,

598
23:50.342 --> 23:51.656
why didn't you call an ambulance

599
23:51.862 --> 23:52.782
to save him?

600
23:53.463 --> 23:54.342
You could have!

601
23:54.862 --> 23:56.302
You did nothing when it happened.

602
23:56.503 --> 23:57.183
You hid the truth

603
23:57.302 --> 23:58.342
afterward.

604
23:59.142 --> 24:00.102
You bear

605
24:01.263 --> 24:02.862
full responsibility for my dad's death.

606
24:03.142 --> 24:04.663
My dad signed that IOU

607
24:05.622 --> 24:07.102
to give you another chance.

608
24:07.663 --> 24:08.862
Did you give him one?

609
24:10.822 --> 24:12.302
He was trying to ruin me!

610
24:13.382 --> 24:13.822
Fine.

611
24:15.423 --> 24:16.183
Then tell me,

612
24:18.622 --> 24:19.822
you came to me, courted me.

613
24:19.943 --> 24:20.663
and married me.

614
24:22.743 --> 24:23.582
Didn't you scare?

615
24:23.903 --> 24:24.983
Living in this house,

616
24:25.142 --> 24:26.486
and lying next to me every night,

617
24:26.903 --> 24:27.983
didn't you have nightmares?

618
24:29.342 --> 24:30.062
Didn't you think

619
24:30.183 --> 24:31.142
my dad was watching you?

620
24:32.743 --> 24:33.503
I did!

621
24:34.183 --> 24:35.062
Of course, I did!

622
24:35.782 --> 24:36.782
It was pure torture!

623
24:37.102 --> 24:38.622
So I tried my best to treat you well.

624
24:39.223 --> 24:39.743
Hui,

625
24:40.263 --> 24:41.142
tell me honestly,

626
24:42.503 --> 24:43.542
during these years,

627
24:44.542 --> 24:45.582
have I mistreated you?

628
24:47.782 --> 24:49.062
Haoyu was born sick.

629
24:50.102 --> 24:51.023
Many people

630
24:51.142 --> 24:52.263
urged me to divorce you.

631
24:52.582 --> 24:53.822
They said I was young

632
24:54.582 --> 24:55.743
and could have another kid.

633
24:56.223 --> 24:56.743
Even so,

634
24:57.743 --> 24:58.703
did I ever give up?

635
24:59.263 --> 25:00.423
What else do you want?

636
25:00.542 --> 25:01.342
You always think

637
25:01.342 --> 25:02.223
you're the victim.

638
25:02.382 --> 25:03.542
It's always others' fault.

639
25:03.903 --> 25:05.062
You're never to blame.

640
25:05.782 --> 25:06.903
My dad forced you into debt.

641
25:07.102 --> 25:08.670
Yu Meng forced you into embezzlement.

642
25:09.703 --> 25:10.463
And I forced you

643
25:10.503 --> 25:11.463
to be a live-in husband.

644
25:12.342 --> 25:12.903
Di Liren,

645
25:14.062 --> 25:15.142
you're such a coward.

646
25:15.703 --> 25:16.463
In your life,

647
25:16.743 --> 25:18.223
you've never taken responsibility

648
25:18.703 --> 25:20.542
for any decision you made.

649
25:21.943 --> 25:23.263
I'm giving you one last chance.

650
25:24.023 --> 25:24.743
Give me the money,

651
25:25.503 --> 25:26.463
and we'll part ways

652
25:26.782 --> 25:27.582
and cut our ties.

653
25:28.102 --> 25:28.943
I have no money.

654
25:31.062 --> 25:32.463
Then why did you ask me to come?

655
25:32.822 --> 25:33.703
To confess your crime

656
25:34.263 --> 25:35.782
and take responsibility

657
25:36.542 --> 25:37.503
for what you did.

658
25:39.663 --> 25:40.542
I turned myself in.

659
25:41.263 --> 25:42.342
The cops will be here soon.

660
25:46.542 --> 25:47.463
You remarried me

661
25:47.663 --> 25:48.943
just to get revenge on me?

662
25:51.542 --> 25:52.102
Why else?

663
25:54.142 --> 25:56.183
Do you think after all this,

664
25:57.943 --> 25:59.263
I would still love you?

665
26:00.862 --> 26:01.503
Sorry.

666
26:02.023 --> 26:03.223
The number you have dialed

667
26:03.342 --> 26:04.503
is currently unavailable.

668
26:04.743 --> 26:05.943
Please try again later.

669
26:06.183 --> 26:06.622
Sorry.

670
26:06.842 --> 26:09.558
(Mom)

671
26:11.463 --> 26:11.862
How's it?

672
26:21.822 --> 26:22.503
Open the door.

673
26:22.943 --> 26:23.382
Let me go.

674
26:25.302 --> 26:25.903
The key.

675
26:27.542 --> 26:28.302
Get a grip!

676
26:28.862 --> 26:29.862
Any later and we're done!

677
26:31.782 --> 26:32.582
I do get a grip.

678
26:37.663 --> 26:38.463
Are you insane?

679
26:40.142 --> 26:41.223
You should've died

680
26:41.342 --> 26:42.142
in the fire!

681
26:42.423 --> 26:43.943
Finally speaking your mind?

682
26:45.582 --> 26:46.983
Do you want to kill me to get

683
26:47.342 --> 26:48.263
the insurance payout?

684
26:51.342 --> 26:52.223
Since you know that,

685
26:52.622 --> 26:53.463
I'll grant your wish.

686
26:54.782 --> 26:55.302
Let...

687
26:55.703 --> 26:56.463
Let go!

688
27:01.582 --> 27:02.223
You choose.

689
27:03.023 --> 27:03.903
Tell the cops

690
27:04.023 --> 27:04.622
not to come,

691
27:05.503 --> 27:06.062
or I'll throw

692
27:06.062 --> 27:06.842
you down from here.

693
27:07.903 --> 27:08.382
Di Liren,

694
27:09.102 --> 27:09.663
think you

695
27:09.782 --> 27:10.463
did well enough?

696
27:11.542 --> 27:13.302
I changed the beneficiary long ago.

697
27:14.023 --> 27:14.943
Even if I die,

698
27:15.703 --> 27:17.102
you won't get a single penny.

699
27:18.622 --> 27:19.382
So what?

700
27:20.382 --> 27:21.590
At worst, I'll just run away!

701
27:22.062 --> 27:22.822
If you kill me,

702
27:23.142 --> 27:24.230
your sentence will worsen.

703
27:24.943 --> 27:25.743
But if you don't,

704
27:26.102 --> 27:27.062
you'll still be in jail.

705
27:27.983 --> 27:29.463
You have no way out.

706
27:30.223 --> 27:31.342
You stole

707
27:31.862 --> 27:33.142
these past twenty years.

708
27:33.663 --> 27:34.983
Now it's time for you to repay.

709
27:36.903 --> 27:37.782
There must be a way.

710
27:38.183 --> 27:39.183
There must be a way.

711
27:41.062 --> 27:42.263
You always claimed

712
27:42.903 --> 27:44.102
that we're parasites,

713
27:44.903 --> 27:46.142
but only you are.

714
27:47.023 --> 27:48.822
You fed off my family,

715
27:49.382 --> 27:50.903
and parasitized in Meng's family.

716
27:51.663 --> 27:53.023
You treated marriage as a stepping stone,

717
27:53.023 --> 27:54.062
women as tools,

718
27:54.503 --> 27:55.743
and human lives as dirt!

719
27:56.503 --> 27:57.903
You think you're invincible,

720
27:58.423 --> 27:59.302
but in reality,

721
27:59.743 --> 28:01.302
you're utterly worthless!

722
28:03.743 --> 28:04.102
Shut up!

723
28:04.903 --> 28:05.663
Shut up!

724
28:06.423 --> 28:06.862
There...

725
28:07.663 --> 28:08.463
There must be a way.

726
28:08.862 --> 28:09.703
There must be a way.

727
28:10.903 --> 28:12.423
I'll tell you a way.

728
28:14.703 --> 28:15.542
Jump down from here,

729
28:16.582 --> 28:17.582
and atone for your sins.

730
28:21.023 --> 28:22.142
No, no.

731
28:24.342 --> 28:24.822
Hui,

732
28:25.822 --> 28:26.463
I'm begging you.

733
28:27.463 --> 28:28.183
I want to live.

734
28:28.903 --> 28:30.108
I don't want to be sentenced.

735
28:30.503 --> 28:31.582
Think about Haoyu.

736
28:32.542 --> 28:33.743
If we both go to prison,

737
28:34.023 --> 28:34.782
what will he do?

738
28:36.503 --> 28:37.622
He'll understand.

739
28:38.582 --> 28:39.423
He is a kind,

740
28:39.582 --> 28:40.703
upright boy.

741
28:41.663 --> 28:42.663
I'm just so glad

742
28:43.503 --> 28:45.023
he's nothing like you.

743
28:46.983 --> 28:47.822
Look at you now,

744
28:47.903 --> 28:49.542
begging like a dog.

745
28:52.463 --> 28:54.782
How pathetic!

746
28:57.903 --> 28:58.342
No!

747
29:15.862 --> 29:16.342
Don't...

748
29:17.382 --> 29:18.142
Don't be reckless.

749
29:19.862 --> 29:20.463
Listen to me.

750
29:21.062 --> 29:21.423
Mom!

751
29:21.503 --> 29:22.342
- Listen to me. - Open up!

752
29:22.342 --> 29:22.703
Mom!

753
29:23.342 --> 29:23.782
Lu Hui!

754
29:24.263 --> 29:25.023
- Haoyu! - Mom!

755
29:25.342 --> 29:25.903
Save me!

756
29:26.423 --> 29:27.503
She is trying to kill me.

757
29:28.223 --> 29:28.743
Mom!

758
29:29.142 --> 29:29.663
Lu Hui!

759
29:30.102 --> 29:31.023
Lu Hui, stay calm!

760
29:31.023 --> 29:31.743
Heard me?

761
29:37.342 --> 29:38.423
Mom, open the door!

762
29:38.423 --> 29:39.463
What about your dream

763
29:39.903 --> 29:40.862
