764
29:40.943 --> 29:42.183
Then what are you doing?

765
29:42.822 --> 29:43.663
Mom!

766
29:44.023 --> 29:46.382
Mom, what about me? Mom!

767
29:46.463 --> 29:47.822
Open the door!

768
29:50.023 --> 29:50.542
Lu Hui,

769
29:51.062 --> 29:52.183
answer me one question.

770
29:52.743 --> 29:53.463
He's ruined

771
29:53.542 --> 29:54.743
the first half of your life.

772
29:54.743 --> 29:55.423
Do you want him

773
29:55.423 --> 29:56.582
to ruin the rest of it?

774
29:57.102 --> 29:58.023
What about Harry?

775
30:00.582 --> 30:01.862
- Mom! - Open up!

776
30:11.503 --> 30:12.382
I didn't expect

777
30:12.542 --> 30:13.582
he's that kind of person.

778
30:19.663 --> 30:20.023
Mom.

779
30:20.703 --> 30:21.023
Mom.

780
30:22.302 --> 30:22.663
Mom!

781
30:23.463 --> 30:23.903
Mom!

782
30:24.903 --> 30:25.423
Let go!

783
30:27.062 --> 30:27.463
Mom!

784
30:28.142 --> 30:28.582
Mom!

785
30:29.023 --> 30:29.503
Mom!

786
30:32.223 --> 30:32.582
Mom!

787
30:33.663 --> 30:34.102
Haoyu,

788
30:35.102 --> 30:36.142
I am so sorry.

789
30:41.062 --> 30:41.463
Mom!

790
30:47.423 --> 30:47.862
Thank you.

791
30:53.703 --> 30:54.102
Mom!

792
30:54.503 --> 30:54.903
You...

793
30:55.342 --> 30:57.703
Let go! Mom!

794
30:57.703 --> 30:59.183
(Some criminal acts in this case)

795
30:59.302 --> 31:00.703
(occurred 21 years ago,)

796
31:00.903 --> 31:02.663
(exceeding the statute of limitations.)

797
31:03.023 --> 31:03.622
(Upon request)

798
31:03.782 --> 31:05.542
(and approval from the Supreme People's Procuratorate,)

799
31:05.542 --> 31:07.023
(we prosecute according to law.)

800
31:07.342 --> 31:08.382
(The defendant, Di Liren,)

801
31:08.582 --> 31:09.983
(chased and threatened victim)

802
31:10.062 --> 31:10.622
(Lu Zhiming,)

803
31:10.743 --> 31:11.782
(causing a car crash.)

804
31:11.983 --> 31:12.983
(He could've helped,)

805
31:13.142 --> 31:14.663
(but he just let Lu Zhiming die.)

806
31:14.983 --> 31:16.822
(His conduct constitutes the crime)

807
31:16.983 --> 31:18.062
(of involuntary manslaughter.)

808
31:18.062 --> 31:19.822
(Pursuant to Article 232 of the Criminal Law)

809
31:19.983 --> 31:21.903
(of the People's Republic of China,)

810
31:22.062 --> 31:24.023
(he is sentenced to 13 years of imprisonment.)

811
31:24.542 --> 31:25.743
(He secretly installed surveillance equipment)

812
31:25.743 --> 31:26.822
(in another's residence,)

813
31:27.062 --> 31:28.822
(constituting the crime of illegal use)

814
31:28.943 --> 31:30.263
(of eavesdropping.)

815
31:30.582 --> 31:31.542
(Pursuant to Article 284)

816
31:31.542 --> 31:32.743
(of the Criminal Law,)

817
31:32.943 --> 31:34.062
(he is sentenced)

818
31:34.223 --> 31:35.382
(for one and a half years.)

819
31:35.382 --> 31:36.743
(Taking advantage of his position)

820
31:36.743 --> 31:37.542
(to accept bribes,)

821
31:37.782 --> 31:38.983
(under particularly serious circumstances,)

822
31:38.983 --> 31:39.862
(pursuant to Article 271)

823
31:39.862 --> 31:41.023
(of the Criminal Law,)

824
31:41.142 --> 31:42.463
(he shall be punished severely.)

825
31:42.663 --> 31:43.703
(Combining all penalties,)

826
31:43.703 --> 31:45.582
(he shall serve 18 years of imprisonment)

827
31:45.703 --> 31:47.342
(and pay a fine of 500,000 yuan.)

828
31:47.743 --> 31:48.862
(The defendant, Lu Hui,)

829
31:48.862 --> 31:49.782
(committed the crime)

830
31:49.943 --> 31:51.463
(of concealing proceeds of crime.)

831
31:51.663 --> 31:52.622
(Pursuant to Article 312)

832
31:52.622 --> 31:53.703
(of the Criminal Law,)

833
31:53.903 --> 31:55.622
(she should be punished accordingly.)

834
31:55.782 --> 31:56.782
(However, considering)

835
31:56.903 --> 31:58.302
(she was unaware of the crime)

836
31:58.463 --> 31:59.465
(at the early stages...)

837
32:03.703 --> 32:04.423
Why are you here?

838
32:05.062 --> 32:06.342
I'm your emergency contact.

839
32:06.582 --> 32:07.102
Forget it?

840
32:07.463 --> 32:08.743
You sent me your location.

841
32:09.342 --> 32:10.223
I was worried,

842
32:10.382 --> 32:11.142
so I rushed over.

843
32:11.983 --> 32:12.903
I saw you were fine,

844
32:13.503 --> 32:14.503
so I didn't disturb you.

845
32:16.423 --> 32:17.542
I just hit it by accident.

846
32:21.263 --> 32:22.263
Then consider it a drill.

847
32:23.263 --> 32:24.023
Excellent results.

848
32:26.423 --> 32:27.342
Thinking back now,

849
32:28.062 --> 32:29.542
it all feels like a dream.

850
32:30.943 --> 32:32.102
Di Liren is in prison,

851
32:32.463 --> 32:34.062
so there won't be any danger anymore.

852
32:35.423 --> 32:36.382
How about

853
32:36.822 --> 32:37.862
I cancel it?

854
32:38.302 --> 32:38.983
Just keep it.

855
32:46.023 --> 32:47.582
I'm not that busy anyway.

856
32:47.822 --> 32:48.703
I'm at your service.

857
32:49.463 --> 32:51.023
If you ever feel bored,

858
32:51.663 --> 32:52.382
you can call me.

859
32:53.023 --> 32:54.542
Wouldn't that be crying wolf?

860
32:55.263 --> 32:56.862
What if I do get in trouble,

861
32:57.142 --> 32:58.342
and you think I'm joking?

862
32:58.463 --> 32:59.183
I wouldn't.

863
32:59.743 --> 33:01.263
I'll show up every time.

864
33:04.542 --> 33:05.102
Every time.

865
33:18.463 --> 33:20.542
Don't say these words

866
33:21.062 --> 33:22.263
that would make you

867
33:22.542 --> 33:23.423
feel so awkward.

868
33:23.622 --> 33:24.622
Or else you'll hiccup.

869
33:26.102 --> 33:26.622
I know

870
33:26.622 --> 33:27.463
why I get hiccups,

871
33:28.342 --> 33:28.983
and

872
33:29.822 --> 33:31.102
how to stop them.

873
33:37.302 --> 33:38.223
Just sip some water.

874
33:47.862 --> 33:49.463
It actually works.

875
33:56.463 --> 33:57.302
Nice view.

876
34:01.663 --> 34:02.223
Indeed.

877
34:06.822 --> 34:07.822
Well...

878
34:09.783 --> 34:10.702
What's on your mind,

879
34:10.742 --> 34:11.182
Mr. Jiao?

880
34:12.463 --> 34:13.702
Want me

881
34:14.383 --> 34:15.303
to pay your bills?

882
34:16.903 --> 34:17.702
I want

883
34:18.383 --> 34:19.383
something else.

884
34:21.023 --> 34:21.582
Like what?

885
34:21.582 --> 34:22.023
Your heart.

886
34:39.542 --> 34:40.222
Maybe because of

887
34:40.222 --> 34:41.383
my parents' work,

888
34:41.823 --> 34:43.262
I've gone through a lot.

889
34:44.262 --> 34:45.582
I think life is short.

890
34:47.343 --> 34:48.783
Plus, being a lawyer,

891
34:49.582 --> 34:50.542
I've seen

892
34:50.702 --> 34:52.742
the very best and worst of human nature.

893
34:54.702 --> 34:55.383
Honestly,

894
34:55.662 --> 34:57.222
I'm a bit of a pessimist deep down.

895
34:57.823 --> 34:58.463
I was prepared

896
34:58.503 --> 34:59.542
to grow old alone.

897
35:01.102 --> 35:01.983
Until I met you.

898
35:04.303 --> 35:05.222
You're kind,

899
35:06.383 --> 35:07.182
brave,

900
35:07.983 --> 35:08.823
dramatic,

901
35:10.222 --> 35:11.503
and even whiny.

902
35:13.102 --> 35:14.023
All those sides of you

903
35:14.542 --> 35:15.343
are so vibrant,

904
35:16.222 --> 35:16.823
filling up

905
35:16.823 --> 35:17.983
my mind completely.

906
35:18.983 --> 35:19.582
As the one

907
35:19.702 --> 35:21.102
who's good at keeping secrets,

908
35:21.582 --> 35:22.742
I can't keep this in anymore.

909
35:22.742 --> 35:23.503
So now,

910
35:24.702 --> 35:25.503
I'll take a leap.

911
35:27.662 --> 35:28.102
Yu Meng,

912
35:30.102 --> 35:30.582
I like you.

913
35:30.582 --> 35:31.383
Be my girlfriend.

914
35:45.023 --> 35:45.903
But

915
35:47.943 --> 35:48.622
I don't want

916
35:48.622 --> 35:50.142
to take a leap anymore.

917
35:53.742 --> 35:54.823
I want to settle down.

918
36:00.222 --> 36:00.742
Sure.

919
36:02.303 --> 36:02.863
Then,

920
36:04.182 --> 36:05.383
take your time

921
36:05.783 --> 36:06.582
and savor this.

922
36:15.343 --> 36:16.062
(It turns out)

923
36:16.463 --> 36:18.303
(the best way to live is to be)

924
36:19.102 --> 36:19.903
(unshaken in heart,)

925
36:20.343 --> 36:21.303
(unwavered by emotions,)

926
36:21.903 --> 36:23.008
(fearless of the future,)

927
36:23.463 --> 36:24.579
(and unburdened by the past.)

928
36:24.579 --> 36:29.142
(The End)

929
36:29.142 --> 36:29.503
Thanks.

930
36:29.784 --> 36:31.903
(Mingshi Media, Grand Opening, A year and a half later)

931
36:31.903 --> 36:33.863
Make a fortune! Congratulations, Miss Yu!

932
36:34.023 --> 36:35.863
- Make a fortune! - Make a fortune!

933
36:36.102 --> 36:36.943
Thank you all.

934
36:36.943 --> 36:38.622
Wishing you all smooth sailing

935
36:38.662 --> 36:40.102
and great fortune!

936
36:40.383 --> 36:41.829
- Great fortune! - Great fortune!

937
36:42.622 --> 36:43.622
Bye.

938
36:45.343 --> 36:46.863
Okay, it's over.

939
36:49.423 --> 36:50.582
Now Mingshi Media

940
36:50.582 --> 36:51.622
is in your hands,

941
36:51.783 --> 36:52.303
Mr. Liu.

942
36:52.702 --> 36:53.102
Miss Yu,

943
36:53.222 --> 36:53.943
you're a shareholder.

944
36:53.943 --> 36:55.222
Just call me Bai.

945
36:55.903 --> 36:56.542
Alright, Bai,

946
36:56.662 --> 36:57.662
pour me a glass of water.

947
36:58.102 --> 36:59.023
You've gone to Beijing,

948
36:59.102 --> 37:00.303
and I've missed you.

949
37:00.863 --> 37:02.062
Well, I'm back now.

950
37:02.222 --> 37:02.662
Then,

951
37:02.943 --> 37:03.662
I'll drop by

952
37:03.662 --> 37:04.622
your club every day

953
37:04.903 --> 37:05.742
and go to you.

954
37:05.823 --> 37:06.662
Don't get sick of me.

955
37:07.622 --> 37:09.262
Ms. Weng, I can't do

956
37:09.303 --> 37:09.983
the legal counsel

957
37:09.983 --> 37:10.622
work anymore.

958
37:10.622 --> 37:11.303
He's annoying.

959
37:11.662 --> 37:12.383
That won't do.

960
37:12.742 --> 37:13.622
The consultations

961
37:13.622 --> 37:14.863
are fully booked.

962
37:15.102 --> 37:16.262
You even have to do overtime.

963
37:16.783 --> 37:17.702
Heard it? Work hard.

964
37:18.303 --> 37:19.102
Work hard.

965
37:19.222 --> 37:19.783
Dad,

966
37:19.823 --> 37:20.823
I want your phone.

967
37:20.943 --> 37:21.463
Sure.

968
37:21.702 --> 37:22.423
Brother-in-law,

969
37:22.423 --> 37:23.463
I want your phone too.

970
37:24.823 --> 37:25.742
You're an adult.

971
37:25.783 --> 37:26.423
Knock it off.

972
37:26.622 --> 37:28.383
Someone from Yaoyan Daily Chemicals is here.

973
37:28.383 --> 37:28.983
Miss Yu.

974
37:31.102 --> 37:32.542
Thank you for coming.

975
37:32.742 --> 37:33.303
Wait,

976
37:33.903 --> 37:34.662
should I call you

977
37:34.662 --> 37:35.783
Chairman Weng

978
37:36.142 --> 37:37.102
by now?

979
37:38.983 --> 37:39.983
I should thank you.

980
37:40.582 --> 37:41.303
Congratulations.

981
37:41.662 --> 37:42.823
I've devoted myself

982
37:42.823 --> 37:43.903
in the cosmetics industry.

983
37:44.262 --> 37:45.102
You're amazing,

984
37:45.582 --> 37:46.903
expanding across so many sectors.

985
37:47.383 --> 37:48.783
A club, We-media,

986
37:49.262 --> 37:50.262
and now you've launched

987
37:50.262 --> 37:51.182
a MCN company.

988
37:51.542 --> 37:52.343
I'm truly impressed.

989
37:52.582 --> 37:53.463
I'm just

990
37:53.463 --> 37:54.622
curious about everything,

991
37:54.983 --> 37:55.783
and I hate doing

992
37:55.783 --> 37:56.823
repetitive things.

993
37:56.943 --> 37:57.903
So I try everything.

994
37:58.582 --> 37:59.503
You're being modest.

995
38:00.102 --> 38:01.102
I'm sure we'll have

996
38:01.102 --> 38:02.062
deep collaborations.

997
38:02.863 --> 38:03.742
Let's go in and chat.

998
38:03.903 --> 38:04.303
Let's go.

999
38:11.027 --> 38:14.126
(Consistent Traffic, Supreme Content, from Yunlu Wellness Center Dean: Lu Hui)

1000
38:14.463 --> 38:15.582
Okay, got it.

1001
38:15.662 --> 38:16.943
I'll close up and go right over.

1002
38:17.062 --> 38:18.262
(Open) Don't worry.

1003
38:18.622 --> 38:19.622
(Closed) I won't be late.

1004
38:20.303 --> 38:21.102
You're closed?

1005
38:22.662 --> 38:23.383
What a pity.

1006
38:23.582 --> 38:24.343
Guess we can't

1007
38:24.383 --> 38:25.622
have a drink together today.

1008
38:30.681 --> 38:32.783
(Wu Ta)

1009
38:33.582 --> 38:34.303
How have you been?

1010
38:35.622 --> 38:36.702
Just graduated with my MBA,

1011
38:36.903 --> 38:38.184
and preparing for the CPA exam.

1012
38:38.702 --> 38:39.622
Learning never ends.

1013
38:40.142 --> 38:41.062
Looks like you're

1014
38:41.662 --> 38:43.222
back on the right track now.

1015
38:44.503 --> 38:45.823
But why do you cancel your number

1016
38:46.222 --> 38:47.423
when going off to study?

1017
38:47.742 --> 38:49.102
I tried to reach you,

1018
38:49.542 --> 38:50.752
but the number is unavailable.

1019
38:51.142 --> 38:52.542
When I decided to leave Jiangzhou,

1020
38:53.142 --> 38:54.102
I wanted a fresh start.

1021
38:54.983 --> 38:55.943
Over these two years,

1022
38:55.943 --> 38:57.343
I've been following your account,

1023
38:57.983 --> 38:59.463
and reflecting on what I've done.

1024
39:00.423 --> 39:01.383
I know you got divorced,

1025
39:02.343 --> 39:03.903
and you're doing really well now.

1026
39:05.262 --> 39:06.463
But I always felt

1027
39:08.062 --> 39:09.023
I owe you an apology.

1028
39:11.062 --> 39:11.742
I'm sorry.

1029
39:12.662 --> 39:13.423
I once

1030
39:13.662 --> 39:14.742
broke up your family.

1031
39:16.182 --> 39:17.423
I used to be so naive,

1032
39:18.222 --> 39:19.503
using twisted logic

1033
39:19.903 --> 39:20.742
to rationalize

1034
39:20.783 --> 39:22.423
my reckless actions.

1035
39:23.783 --> 39:24.542
Thinking back now,

1036
39:25.222 --> 39:25.823
it's all wrong.

1037
39:27.023 --> 39:27.983
I'm so grateful

1038
39:28.383 --> 39:29.622
you didn't give me a hard time,

1039
39:29.943 --> 39:30.903
and treated me as a friend,

1040
39:31.742 --> 39:32.823
letting me start over.

1041
39:34.463 --> 39:35.702
Back then, we were just allies.

1042
39:42.383 --> 39:43.343
But now,

1043
39:44.023 --> 39:45.062
perhaps you and I

1044
39:46.062 --> 39:47.383
have a chance to be friends.

1045
39:53.413 --> 39:57.558
(Jiangzhou Shouzheng Prison, A few years later)

1046
40:03.343 --> 40:04.303
This is Di Liren,

1047
40:04.343 --> 40:05.863
who's on medical parole.

1048
40:06.182 --> 40:07.350
Here's his medical record.

1049
40:07.383 --> 40:08.542
Stress-induced cardiomyopathy,

1050
40:08.542 --> 40:09.573
risk of sudden death.

1051
40:09.823 --> 40:11.142
The guarantor should sign here.

1052
40:14.622 --> 40:15.503
I'm the guarantor.

1053
40:15.943 --> 40:16.903
I'm his wife,

1054
40:17.463 --> 40:18.823
and his legal guardian.

1055
40:33.343 --> 40:34.222
Alright, you may go.

1056
40:57.503 --> 40:58.102
Hui,

1057
40:59.582 --> 41:00.463
why is it you?

1058
41:02.622 --> 41:03.383
What do you want?

1059
41:04.983 --> 41:06.182
I'm begging you to let me off.

1060
41:06.823 --> 41:07.863
Do you want to torture me?

1061
41:10.463 --> 41:11.023
Hui,

1062
41:11.582 --> 41:12.542
let's get divorced.

1063
41:13.463 --> 41:14.463
Don't let me burden you.

1064
41:18.343 --> 41:19.142
Long time no see,

1065
41:20.622 --> 41:21.102
honey.

1066
41:38.463 --> 41:39.503
I have to end

1067
41:40.182 --> 41:41.783
the story myself.

1068
41:43.383 --> 41:43.943
I know

1069
41:44.303 --> 41:45.463
you've been waiting for this

1070
41:46.343 --> 41:47.742
to truly move on.

1071
41:49.383 --> 41:51.182
At last, this story

1072
41:51.582 --> 41:52.903
has finally come to an end.

1073
41:54.702 --> 41:55.903
Only when this story ends

1074
41:56.423 --> 41:58.142
can the next one begin.

1075
41:59.622 --> 42:00.062
Right?

1076
42:04.262 --> 42:06.102
(From a wealthy lady to a trophy wife,)

1077
42:06.582 --> 42:08.823
(to an independent woman)

1078
42:08.863 --> 42:09.463
(establishing myself...)

1079
42:10.423 --> 42:11.303
(During this journey,)

1080
42:11.622 --> 42:12.742
(those who warmed me)

1081
42:13.062 --> 42:14.343
(will make me braver.)

1082
42:14.903 --> 42:16.182
(Those who hurt me)

1083
42:16.383 --> 42:17.582
(will make me stronger.)

1084
42:18.702 --> 42:19.983
(Believing that everything)

1085
42:20.062 --> 42:21.423
(works for my ultimate good,)

1086
42:21.823 --> 42:23.142
(I stumbled through to this day.)

1087
42:23.702 --> 42:25.222
(Every hardship has passed.)

1088
42:26.582 --> 42:27.622
(I found myself,)

1089
42:28.182 --> 42:29.142
(embraced myself,)

1090
42:29.863 --> 42:30.542
(and thank myself)

1091
42:30.983 --> 42:31.662
(and all those)

1092
42:31.702 --> 42:32.702
(who gave me strength.)

1093
42:34.062 --> 42:34.903
(Please allow me)

1094
42:35.182 --> 42:36.383
(to reintroduce myself.)

1095
42:37.383 --> 42:38.102
(Hello, everyone.)

1096
42:38.222 --> 42:40.182
(I am the owner of Yueji Cosmetics,)

1097
42:40.423 --> 42:42.062
(a partner in Wu Ta Club,)

1098
42:42.262 --> 42:44.023
(a content creator Lucky Beauty Yu,)

1099
42:44.582 --> 42:46.463
(and a lucky woman)

1100
42:46.503 --> 42:47.222
(who always runs forward,)

1101
42:47.503 --> 42:47.983
(Yu Meng.)

1102
42:48.983 --> 42:50.542
(I hope you all continue to follow me)

1103
42:50.783 --> 42:51.222
(and support me.)

1104
42:51.742 --> 42:52.582
(Love you all!)

1105
42:56.329 --> 42:57.965
(Level Cleared)

1106
43:13.184 --> 43:18.053
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1107
43:20.537 --> 43:25.400
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1108
43:27.858 --> 43:32.703
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1109
43:33.148 --> 43:39.650
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1110
43:42.382 --> 43:49.335
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1111
43:49.885 --> 43:55.815
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1112
43:56.939 --> 44:04.170
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1113
44:04.473 --> 44:09.646
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1114
44:10.266 --> 44:21.734
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1115
44:24.234 --> 44:29.482
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1116
44:31.523 --> 44:36.958
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1117
44:38.780 --> 44:44.177
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1118
44:44.177 --> 44:52.822
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1119
44:53.298 --> 45:00.861
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1120
45:00.861 --> 45:06.707
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1121
45:06.707 --> 45:16.874
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
